      "message": "I\u0027m missing `Gitiles` in that list of Soy-dependent projects — and it\u0027s probably the heaviest one. Unlike Gerrit, where Soy is limited to a few email/landing-page templates, Gitiles renders its entire web UI from Soy templates:\n\n```bash\n$ ls -1 resources/com/google/gitiles/templates/*.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/BlameDetail.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/Common.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/DiffDetail.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/Doc.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/Error.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/HostIndex.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/LogDetail.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/ObjectDetail.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/PathDetail.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/RefList.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/RepositoryIndex.soy\nresources/com/google/gitiles/templates/RevisionDetail.soy\n```\n\nSo whatever replacement is chosen has to cover Gitiles\u0027 rendering too — it\u0027s likely the largest single Soy migration in the ecosystem, and worth folding into @hariprak@google.com\u0027s replacement-system investigation rather than discovering it later.",
